Package: bambaganaCI
Title: Confidence Intervals and Classical Statistical Inference
Version: 0.3.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Silas", "Bambil", , "sdbambil98@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yasmeen", "Babagana", email = "ybabagana1@student.gsu.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Provides a common interface for descriptive statistics,
    confidence intervals, hypothesis tests, association measures, linear-model
    inference, analysis of variance, and model-based power planning. Readable task
    names and a searchable function catalog help users locate established
    statistical procedures without replacing their underlying implementations.
    Direct function access and standard result objects remain available.
    Method-specific documentation describes assumptions and limitations.
